&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:7.7pt;padding-right:7.7pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;大阪市中央区南本町に本社を移転、国際貨物輸送事業を開始&lt;/p&gt;
